{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"fb64cbf9-b60e-4920-bc4f-b051258cb529","agentId":"a7676847d82e04abb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"P0 #6 改造 5（sentinel-row）数学 + sentinel 不撞车 audit。\n\n**背景**：R12 patch blueprint agent (`a91a3c90b172df1ce`) 给了改造 5 蓝图：\n```python\n# before (around line 2724-2733 in src/models/exact_coordinate_master.py)\nif shell_pair_rows:\n    self.model.AddAllowedAssignments(\n        [d_lo, d_hi, shell_pair_idx], shell_pair_rows\n    ).OnlyEnforceIf(slot.active)\n    self.model.Add(shell_pair_idx <= sentinel_pair_index - 1).OnlyEnforceIf(slot.active)\nself.model.Add(shell_pair_idx == sentinel_pair_index).OnlyEnforceIf(slot.active.Not())\n\n# after — 哨兵行让表本身覆盖 inactive\nsentinel_row = (sentinel_d_lo, sentinel_d_hi, sentinel_pair_index)\nall_rows = list(shell_pair_rows) + [sentinel_row]\nself.model.AddAllowedAssignments([d_lo, d_hi, shell_pair_idx], all_rows)  # 无条件\nself.model.Add(shell_pair_idx == sentinel_pair_index).OnlyEnforceIf(slot.active.Not())\n```\n\n**已知 caveat**（之前 audit 发现）：\n- d_lo / d_hi **没有** inactive enforcement（grep 0 匹配 `d_lo.*OnlyEnforceIf.*active`）→ 改造 5 需要新增这部分\n- agent 警告\"必须保证 sentinel_d_lo, sentinel_d_hi 不与任何真实 (d_lo, d_hi) 撞车\"\n\n**任务（≤700 字）**：\n\n1. 读 `D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\src\\models\\exact_coordinate_master.py` line 2700-2900（包含 power pole shell guard region）找到：\n   - `shell_pair_rows` 怎么构造的（具体 (d_lo, d_hi) 值）\n   - d_lo / d_hi 的变量域定义（NewIntVar 的 lower/upper）\n   - sentinel_pair_index 怎么算\n2. **数学条件验证**：\n   - 是否存在不撞车的 sentinel (d_lo, d_hi) 值（即所有 real shell_pair_rows 都不含此 (d_lo, d_hi)）？\n   - 推荐取何值？（提示：domain extreme + 不在 family_by_pair 中）\n3. **inactive 强制**：当前 inactive 情况下 d_lo / d_hi 取什么值？是否需要新增 `OnlyEnforceIf(slot.active.Not())` 强制取 sentinel？\n4. **CP-SAT 表约束 enforcement vs 无条件实测**：\n   - AddAllowedAssignments + OnlyEnforceIf 在 v9.15 propagator 中是否真的弱于无条件？\n   - 蓝图说\"传播显著弱于无条件版\"——能否提供 paper/issue 引用？\n5. **PROJECT_LOCK Forbidden Changes**：\n   - 不动 ghost rectangle 几何 ✓ (改造 5 是 power pole shell guard)\n   - 哨兵行不引入新 ghost 行为\n6. **风险评估**：\n   - 哨兵不撞车需要验证 → unit test 必须\n   - inactive 强制如果漏了 → CP-SAT 可能让 d_lo/d_hi 取 sentinel 值同时 slot.active=1（不一致）\n\n**约束**：不要改代码，只给 verdict + patch 蓝图修订（含哨兵值具体推荐）+ 风险\n\n输出末尾：'P0 #6 改造 5 verdict = SAFE/UNSAFE_AS_BLUEPRINTED/NEEDS_DEEPER_AUDIT' + 是否值得实施 + 如果 SAFE 给精确 sentinel 值推荐"},"uuid":"664b7e39-fe3c-469a-b468-ac206134a259","timestamp":"2026-05-08T00:47:57.270Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
